  "Check only the sentences that cite {key}: pass key: {key} to citations_list.": "仅核查引用了 {key} 的句子：将 key: {key} 传给 citations_list。",
  "Check that the works this paper cites support what it says about them. Go through the citing sentences with citations_list; unchecked: true lists those still to check. For each sentence and each work it cites that has a PDF, find what the work says with library_search and library_read, then record a verdict with citation_record, giving the lines that show it as evidence: supported, partial (it supports part of the claim, or a weaker or narrower one), unsupported (it does not say this, or says otherwise), or unclear (its text does not settle it). Do not edit any file. End with the unsupported and partial citations, and the works without a PDF that could not be checked.": "核查本论文引用的文献是否支持论文中对其的论述。使用 citations_list 遍历引用句；unchecked: true 会列出尚待核查的句子。对于每个句子及其引用的每篇带有 PDF 的文献，使用 library_search 和 library_read 查找该文献的表述，然后用 citation_record 记录判定结果，并给出作为依据的原文行：supported（支持）、partial（支持部分论点，或支持较弱、较窄的论点）、unsupported（未提及此内容，或表述相反）或 unclear（原文无法定论）。请勿编辑任何文件。最后汇总不支持和部分支持的引用，以及因缺少 PDF 而无法核查的文献。",
  "Check the work with library_read first. Add the citation where the claim ends, with the citation command the paper already uses, and change nothing else.": "请先使用 library_read 检查该文献。在论点结束处使用论文现有的引用命令添加引用，不要做其他任何修改。",
